    "Name": "Sobek",
    "Details": "The SBK-2B2 mounts a combination of LRM and SRM weapons, combined with a Thumper Cannon, two PPCs and two Medium Lasers. Nothing in particular stands out about the model, but it fulfills its duties without issues.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.36</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
